### Memory Tier Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    AGENT MEMORY HIERARCHY                        │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  TIER 0 │ In-Context Working Memory (current conversation)       │
│         │ ≤ 128K tokens │ Lost on session end                   │
