<a name="english"></a>
## English

### Orchestration & Integration
- **Upstream Orchestrators**: Works under `brainstorming` and `zero-to-prod-orchestrator` (Phase 5 - Core Feature Development & Media Generation) to integrate multimodal generative pipelines.
