---

### Panduan Pemilihan Protokol API

| Kriteria | REST | GraphQL | gRPC | tRPC |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Type Safety** | Manual (OpenAPI) | Berbasis Skema | Protobuf | End-to-end TypeScript |
