| **KV-Cache & Token Protocol** | Pin static instructions & schemas at prompt prefix (`kv-cache-prefix-optimizer`); pass surgical `CONTEXT_MAP.md` slices (<250 tokens/call) during Swarm Fan-Out |
| **SaaT CLI & MCP Dispatch** | CLI: `vibes skill exec blockchain-web3-expert <audit\|eval\|verify\|generate\|blueprint>` / MCP: `vibes_skill_dispatch`, `vibes_ast_query`, `vibes_compile_cache`, `vibes_optimize_budget`, `vibes_verify_gate` |
| **NFR & Anti-Slop Invariants** | Transaction simulation success rate >= 99%, BigInt minor unit token math 100%, zero private key exposure in client bundles; 100% complete zero-placeholder output verified via `node scripts/check-anti-slop.js --strict` |

---


