| **Kaskade Model Frontier** | High Fast / High (`Gemini 4 Carbon`, `Gemini 4 Neon`, `Grok 4.7 High Fast`, `Claude Sonnet 5.5 High`, `Gemini 4 Pro`) |
| **Invarian Fallback Ketersediaan** | `Gemini 4 (Carbon/Hydrogen/Neon/Argon/Pro)` -> `Gemini 3.8 Flash`; `Claude Opus 5.5` -> `Claude Opus 4.6`; `Grok 4.7` -> `Grok 4.6 High Fast` (Bebas gagal saat model belum tersedia/kuota penuh) |
| **Protokol Hemat Token & KV-Cache** | Kunci instruksi & skema statis di prefix awal (`kv-cache-prefix-optimizer`); kirim potongan `CONTEXT_MAP.md` (<250 token/panggilan) saat Fan-Out |
| **Eksekusi SaaT CLI & MCP** | CLI: `vibes skill exec blockchain-web3-expert <audit\|eval\|verify\|generate\|blueprint>` / MCP: `vibes_skill_dispatch`, `vibes_ast_query`, `vibes_compile_cache`, `vibes_optimize_budget`, `vibes_verify_gate` |
| **Invarian NFR & Anti-Slop** | Tingkat keberhasilan simulasi transaksi >= 99%, matematika token unit minor BigInt 100%, zero paparan private key di bundle klien; kode 100% tuntas tanpa placeholder diverifikasi melalui `node scripts/check-anti-slop.js --strict` |

