| **Kaskade Model Frontier** | Medium / High (`Gemini 4 Neon`, `Gemini 4 Hydrogen`, `Gemini 4 Argon`, `GPT-5.6 Sol Medium`, `Claude Sonnet 5.5 High`, `Grok 4.7 High Fast`) |
